WEBVTT

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:04.920
<i>Ever since I was little,</i>

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:09.280
<i>I've been able to see things 
ordinary people can't.</i>

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:30.330
<i>Deep sea fish live at a depth of greater 
than 200 meters in harsh environments</i>

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:33.300
<i>where they are subject 
to high water pressure,</i>

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.580
<i>low temperatures, and hydrothermal vents.</i>

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>We've still only discovered 1% of them.</i>

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:48.200
<i>Their world is even more unfathomable 
and unknown than outer space.</i>

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:55.800
Toru!

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.950
See? I told you he'd be here.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:01.340
We looked everywhere for you.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:04.170
It's too dangerous for you 
to go to the aquarium alone.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:08.460
<b>Deep Sea Fish Exhibit</b>

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:07.080
But the deep sea fish 
exhibit is only open now.

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:10.510
It's okay, Mom.

00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:12.910
Toru can ride the train by himself.

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:16.480
He's the most mature out of all of us.

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:18.590
See any new species?

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:24.930
Is this a new species?

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:26.950
What? Which one?

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:29.560
Right here, in front of my finger.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.890
There's nothing there.

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:34.570
What?

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.410
There is, though. Right here.

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:40.780
Look closely.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:41.910
What?

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:47.750
<b>Makino Psychosomatic Clinic</b>

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:47.160
Kuromori Toru-kun.

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:52.210
Ever since he was little, he's
claimed to see strange things.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.750
Toru-kun, what is it that you see?

00:01:56.270 --> 00:01:58.000
Will you tell me?

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:03.440
<i>People go to hospitals when they're sick.</i>

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:08.690
<i>I see strange things, which means I'm sick.</i>

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:12.710
I'm sorry. I lied.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.650
I don't see anything.

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:22.730
<i>I shouldn't tell anyone 
that I see things anymore.</i>

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:25.050
<i>My family will worry.</i>

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:28.930
What's wrong, Toru?

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:32.430
Nothing.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:39.840
<i>Someday, I won't see them anymore.</i>

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:42.790
<i>Someday, surely.</i>

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:14.350
<b>Dr. Ramune
Mysterious Disease Specialist</b>

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:23.030
<b>Episode 10 "Toru's Deeply Mysterious Story - Part One"</b>

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:23.030
<b>Kuromori Dojo</b>

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.410
I... I give up...

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.370
Okay, that's enough!

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.710
Hotate, keep your arms close to your sides.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:30.410
<b>Eldest Son - Hotate</b>

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:30.400
Yes, Dad!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:34.540
<b>Second Son - Kurage</b>

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:33.710
Kurage, maintain focus.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:34.530
Yes, Dad.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:38.790
<b>Eldest Daughter - Azuma</b>

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.780
Azuma, you've been doing well recently.

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:38.790
Thanks.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:43.050
<b>Second Daughter - Tsurara</b>

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:42.350
Tsurara, just keep being cute.

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:47.470
The coach's kids are too strong.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.510
I lost to a little girl.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:53.520
<b>Third Son - Toru</b>

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:51.630
What's wrong, Toru?

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:53.600
You've been low on energy recently.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.630
Time to eat, everyone!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.950
Sorry. I don't need lunch.

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.120
Toru-nii, you gotta eat!

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:03.820
You're gonna eat today!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.030
I'm not hungry, though...

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:09.790
You say that every single time!

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:12.450
What have you been doing 
in your room by yourself?

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:13.970
I...

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:16.040
Now, now, guys.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.050
Toru's having a tough time.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.010
He just entered middle school, remember?

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:22.080
It's a prep school, so he's 
got a lot of homework.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:26.200
And challengers from other 
schools pick fights with him

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.330
just because he's part 
of the Kuromori family.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.380
He's a tough kid.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:32.830
He'll get used to his new school 
right away and return to form.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.220
You're right.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.530
Which means, dear sisters,

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:41.070
even if he's hiding in his room, 
you mustn't doubt Toru!

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:44.100
There are things about being a man 
that only other men can understand.

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:46.150
Like what?! What things?

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:47.200
Tell us!

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.540
Don't chase the truth too far!

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:49.360
It'll cost your lives!

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.470
I'll hold them here!

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:53.150
Go on, Toru!

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:54.760
What's your problem?!

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:56.120
Move, Ahoge!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.180
My name is Kurage!

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.360
Shut up, stupid!

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:58.360
And you've got an ahoge, too!

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.380
<b><i>Toru</i></b>

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.580
<i>I'm hungry.</i>

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:14.040
<i>But if I eat, then...</i>

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:17.640
Toru, your brothers have arrived!

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:20.880
Kurage-nii, Hotate-nii.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.820
You're worried about something, right?

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:23.950
Talk to us.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:25.890
Worried?

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:27.400
You can't fool us.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.780
We can see everything.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.340
Um...

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:39.600
You don't have to force yourself to tell us.

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:41.500
We know, we know.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:45.300
We were both rather troubled 
when we were your age.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:45.660
What?

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:47.660
When you're feeling troubled, watch this.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:51.300
<b>Big Titty Teacher</b>

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:51.300
Seduced by Her Student

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:51.300
<b>The Unique Relationship Between
 a Teacher and Her Student</b>

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:51.580
I borrowed this adult 
video from Hotate's room!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.710
By the way, it's about a teacher.

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:54.790
That's <i>not</i> it.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.770
Kurage, what are you doing?!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.460
In any case, it's nothing!

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.850
You think he prefers nurses?

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:06.640
Shut up.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:15.410
<b>Toru</b>

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:10.630
Anyway, if he's that 
determined not to tell us,

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.660
I'm sure he can resolve 
whatever it is on his own.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:15.410
You're right. Toru's a mature kid.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.630
He'll be fine.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:27.540
Why? I didn't eat anything today.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:32.320
<i>I cough up sand whenever I eat.</i>

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:35.160
<i>Sometimes it happens even if I don't eat.</i>

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:40.170
<i>I'm hungry.</i>

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.060
I see hallucinations

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:49.770
Go away!

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:50.650
Just disappear!

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:01.360
<i>Am I crazy?</i>

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.170
I see hallucinations

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.170
Diseases that cause hallucinations

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.170
Hallucinations and illusions

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.170
I see things that aren't 
there (hallucinations)

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.170
Hallucinations and illusions
 caused by dementia

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:08.590
Diseases that cause hallucinations

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:08.590
Are you worried because you're different from others?

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:08.590
We can help you solve any problem.

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:08.590
Come talk to us.

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:08.590
Manumerous Group

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.640
<b>Manumerous</b>

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:19.230
Never mind.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:20.630
You there.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:25.840
You've come here because you're troubled by 
something you can't tell others, right?

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:27.710
I can tell.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:30.050
After all, I can see everything.

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:32.610
You can see them, too?

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:33.770
Yes.

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:38.510
Tell me. Your heart will feel lighter.

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:41.660
The truth is...

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:43.910
I see.

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:48.070
People like you and I who can see everything

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:52.670
sometimes attract "impurities" 
due to our special power.

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:57.630
However, I can drive away those impurities.

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:03.530
I shall save you.

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:09.660
Noshitawa janshi tenanni ributatsu sefuo...

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:11.020
Neteshi!

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.610
<i>I shouldn't have talked to him.</i>

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:21.550
<i>There's no way that would change anything.</i>

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:23.050
<i>Ridiculous.</i>

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:28.830
<i>There's a shrine here, huh?</i>

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.120
<i>I don't want to go home.</i>

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:37.670
<i>Everyone's been noticing 
that I'm acting strange.</i>

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.260
<i>I can't let them worry.</i>

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:53.570
<i>The weird things are gone.</i>

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:58.320
<i>Did that exorcism actually 
work? That's not...</i>

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.580
<i>Wait, but—</i>

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.410
<i>I can breathe more easily.</i>

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:04.710
<i>My body feels lighter, too.</i>

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:10.600
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:13.850
<i>I haven't gotten much sleep recently.</i>

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:28.940
Offerings

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.000
Who's this?

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:48.770
Hey, kid. Did you run away from home?

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:51.340
You'll catch a cold sleeping out here.

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:57.500
<i>What's this? His stomach, huh?</i>

00:10:57.940 --> 00:10:59.830
<i>Looks pretty bad.</i>

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:03.810
Kid, wake up. I'll take a look at you.

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:05.820
Hey, ki—

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:11.600
<b>Mysterious Disease
 Specialist</b>

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.600
Who attacks people in their sleep?

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:16.350
<i>Anyway, it doesn't look like 
you've been eating properly.</i>

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:20.510
Wait here. I'll make you something to eat.

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.330
Something smells good.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:45.740
<i>It's delicious.</i>

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:03.060
I'm sorry for eating your offerings.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.080
Thanks for the food.

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:08.530
Crap. I overslept.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:11.820
Hey, kid!

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:14.410
I made some pork miso udon, too.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:16.330
It's about time you wo—

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:19.180
Huh? He's not here.

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:27.730
<i>I didn't cough up sand today even 
though I ate those rice balls.</i>

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:32.280
<i>I doubted that man,</i>

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:35.590
<i>but his power was real.</i>

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:41.410
<i>That's right. I'm not crazy.</i>

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:44.360
<i>I can be cured.</i>

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:57.910
<i>I'll have him exorcise me 
again on the way home.</i>

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:00.900
<i>I'm not crazy.</i>

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:04.410
<i>I can be cured.</i>

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:08.290
Ugh, what's going on?

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.800
Hey, I'm looking for someone. 
Have you seen him?

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:14.550
He was wearing your school uniform 
and was about this small.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.620
<i>Yikes, a shady character.</i>

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:21.380
There you are! Boy, am I glad I found you.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:24.340
What do you want? Who are you? 
I'm calling the cops.

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:27.050
Wait, wait, wait. I'm a doctor.

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:29.300
You don't look like one to me.

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:31.010
I'm not lying.

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:33.680
I came to cure your disease.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:35.230
My disease?

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:36.280
Yeah, that's right.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.920
Your strange disease caused by stress.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:41.040
Well, put simply,

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:43.310
it's a mental illness.

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.470
<i>Toru-kun, what do you see?</i>

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:48.550
<i>Will you tell me?</i>

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:53.640
I'm not sick.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.410
Hold on. If you're not 
treated immediately—

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:02.450
I've caught a suspicious person! 
Please call the police!

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:02.130
Ow, ow, ow!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:03.230
What?

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:05.450
Hey, listen to me!

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:08.810
Who would trust someone as 
ridiculously dressed as you?

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:09.980
Hey, wait!

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:11.920
Stop resisting!

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:13.240
I'm not a suspicious person.

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:15.980
Just look at these clear, bright eyes.

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:18.290
That's what all suspicious people say!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.960
No, wait! There's nothing 
suspicious about me!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.790
Ah, you came.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:30.880
I knew you'd be back. I see everything.

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:33.690
I finally slept well last night.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:38.140
God's Chosen People

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.870
Could you exorcise me again?

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.150
Of course.

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:40.350
I'll join your group.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:46.270
<i>This place is full of good people.</i>

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:48.910
<i>In contrast,</i>

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:53.740
<i>who calls someone sick after 
meeting them for the first time?</i>

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:58.130
<i>I'm not crazy.</i>

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.310
<i>I can be cured.</i>

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.830
<i>As long as I stay here, 
eventually I'll be cured.</i>

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:16.040
Why? But I had him exorcise me again today.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:21.420
It hurts. I hate this.

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:24.190
I want to feel better.

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:26.950
Go away!

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:33.870
I knew it. He's got an 
unusual mysterious disease.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.320
He can see, huh?

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:42.470
Anyway, what am I going to do?

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:48.140
Not only is he terrifying, but 
that group is sketchy, too.

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:56.680
I see. Thank you for telling me.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:01.430
It's all right. Just do as I say.

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:07.440
If you do, then you'll be freed 
from all the things troubling you.

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:16.200
<b>The strong prey
 on the strong</b>

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.630
A study camp?

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:18.950
Yeah. Apparently people are staying at 
school to study over Golden Week, so...

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:24.200
I see. Attending a prep 
school must be tough.

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:29.050
Your studies are important, but 
don't forget to keep training.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.670
He won't be coming home for a while, huh?

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:38.430
<b>Kuromori Dojo</b>

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.900
I hope Toru-nii doesn't get lonely.

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:38.770
You don't need to worry about him.

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:41.770
Toru's the smartest one in the family.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:45.490
That's right. Toru will be fine.

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:49.990
Sir, this uniform...

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:51.480
You noticed, huh?

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:53.710
We can use that kid.

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:55.980
Whatever you do, don't let him get away.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:16:59.850
What's going on?

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.230
Who is he?

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:03.740
Please help me!

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:09.560
I was born with the ability 
to see strange things.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:12.770
I'm so scared.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:14.750
Please help me.

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:18.020
Sir, this man is a suspicious person!

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:21.810
How dare you! I simply came 
here because I wanted help.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:24.760
Very well. Come in.

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:24.760
What?

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:31.490
As one given this power, it is my task 
to save all those who are troubled.

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:35.720
Thank you so very much, sir.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:39.030
<b>Eye Drops</b>

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:42.490
Hey. We meet again, kid.

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:50.000
Ow, ow, ow! Stop that!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.300
Why are you here?

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:55.200
I told you, because I see strange things.

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:58.320
You two, it's time to receive his teachings.

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:01.230
Okay. We'll be right there.

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:05.480
Oh, right. I'll show you 
something special later.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.030
Special?

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:08.700
You won't want to miss it.

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:13.600
Purge their impurities and save them.

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:18.410
Suffering comes to those who have power.

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:23.740
The fact that you suffer 
proves that you are special.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:33.380
<b>God's Chosen People</b>

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:28.000
Today we welcome a new member to our group.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:32.370
I believe you said you were troubled by 
the strange things you see, correct?

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:33.390
That's right.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:39.290
I see. I see everything.

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:42.520
You have the same power that we—

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:43.770
Liar.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:47.630
You can't actually see anything, can you?

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:50.850
How dare you say that to the founder!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.970
Yeah! Apologize immediately!

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:54.050
Apologize!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:58.900
In that case, can you see this?

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:04.400
<i>He can see them, too?</i>

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.150
What are you talking about?

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:08.420
What's supposed to be there?

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.750
Yeah! There's nothing there!

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:10.760
I don't see anything!

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:12.900
Are you pretending you can see? Enough!

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:13.680
Fool!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:15.240
Well, that settles that.

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:14.950
What's his problem?

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:20.180
Here.

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.710
Contact me anytime.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:24.440
What was that about?

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:26.420
Throw him out of here!

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:29.910
And don't come back!

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:33.450
Ow... Damn that conman.

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:37.000
<b>Manumerous Group</b>

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:36.090
Well, whatever.

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:40.190
That should open his eyes.

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:49.470
It seems that ordinary training 
won't be enough to save you.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:20:00.830
I shall perform a special cleansing 
to exorcise your impurities.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:08.030
Doctor, thank you.

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:10.610
You're welcome. Take care.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:15.600
Mysterious disease that turns 
lips into cod roe, cured.

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:19.120
He still hasn't called yet.

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:23.860
I didn't write down my 
phone number wrong, did I?

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:29.690
What are you doing, Moke-chan?

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.470
What?! Could it be?

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:42.110
<i>You require greater spiritual training.</i>

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:47.500
<i>Once this is over, you'll be 
freed from all suffering.</i>

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:52.170
<i>Is staying here really the right choice?</i>

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:52.470
<i>You require greater spiritual training.</i>

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:55.070
<i>Once this is over, you'll be 
freed from all suffering.</i>

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:57.950
<i>But that day, because of his power...</i>

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:03.390
Found it.

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:07.190
I really don't want to use this, but...

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:36.280
<i>What should I believe?</i>

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.350
Wait for me, kid.

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:48.700
Come to think of it, what's his name?

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:53.190
I forgot to ask!

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:28.630
<i>Kuro, you call me "Doctor," right?</i>

00:23:28.630 --> 00:23:29.960
<i>Where did that come from?</i>

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:32.470
<i>Does that mean you've got a thing for—</i>

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:33.630
<i>No!</i>

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:35.310
Dr. Ramune -Mysterious Disease Specialist-.

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:39.340
<i>Episode 11, "Toru's Deeply 
Mysterious Story, Part Two."</i>

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Episode 11
